==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{compound|en|pineal|gland}}, from its pine-cone shape.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈpaɪ.niːəl ˌɡlænd/|/ˈpɪ.niːəl ˌɡlænd/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy|neuroanatomy}} A small, pinecone-shaped [[endocrine gland]] found near the centre of the brain that produces [[melatonin]].

